===Proverb===
{{head|en|proverb|head=[[don't]] [[cry]] [[over]] [[spilt]] [[milk]]}}

# It is no use [[worry]]ing about [[unfortunate]] [[event]]s which have [[already]] [[happen]]ed and which cannot be [[change]]d.

